---
// Decorative Hong Kong skyline across the Home header, tinted with the theme's contour colour.
---

<div class="skyline" aria-hidden="true"></div>

<style>
  .skyline {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: var(--contour);
    -webkit-mask: url("/hk-skyline.png") repeat-x center bottom / auto 100%;
    mask: url("/hk-skyline.png") repeat-x center bottom / auto 100%;
    opacity: 0.09;
    pointer-events: none;
  }
</style>
